  "title": "Golden Pork Chops",
  "description": "This is so yummy, I never make enough. Seasoned pork chops are smothered in a golden mushroom sauce and baked with fresh mushroom slices and onion.",
  "authors": [
    "Hallie Guilfoyle"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-05-12T15:54:06-04:00",
